How to run 

Clone the git repo

https://github.com/arunreddyyy/glow-pulse.git

go to the coding platform which you do(Eg: vs code)
get the cloned files into it and run in you browser

             "OR"

Run it through the git repo deployed link, following

https://arunreddyyy.github.io/glow-pulse/

If you want to make any changes in the code to make it better or any 

go to the javascript file in the files

change the the following if you want...

 k < 3 set the rings when we tap
 k * 70 it sets how many different colors the ypu want.
 r.r += 4 speed of the rings.
 g.lineWidth = 3 thickness of the rings.

 only change these things other than it dont touch it at all
 
I have Used HTML , CSS , and JavaScript to build this web page.

Project Obective

I wanted to make somthing simple and calm that anyone can play with just by touching the screen.